{"2088590": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Eleven Sunrises", "steam_appid": 2088590, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stricken with amnesia in the heart of a scorched land, you are the target of ruthless hordes. To triumph in the hellish world of Eleven Sunrises, combine exploration, firepower, and defensive strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2088590/extras/52f8c16af750aed9a7d44c67a99604d2.poster.avif?t=1785936675\" width=640 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2088590/extras/52f8c16af750aed9a7d44c67a99604d2.webm?t=1785936675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2088590/extras/52f8c16af750aed9a7d44c67a99604d2.mp4?t=1785936675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why are you here ?  Are there any other survivors? </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the Wastelands</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2088590/extras/7b32d4489e5df5b1252d60c20624db14.poster.avif?t=1785936675\" width=640 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2088590/extras/7b32d4489e5df5b1252d60c20624db14.webm?t=1785936675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2088590/extras/7b32d4489e5df5b1252d60c20624db14.mp4?t=1785936675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore and conquer new territories. During this trip, you will find the food and weapons necessary for your survival. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Your Line of Defense</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2088590/extras/ed71b3b428bbba78277996db1a8d109f.poster.avif?t=1785936675\" width=640 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2088590/extras/ed71b3b428bbba78277996db1a8d109f.webm?t=1785936675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2088590/extras/ed71b3b428bbba78277996db1a8d109f.mp4?t=1785936675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fear the light - Fear the night</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A single energy, a single invincible enemy… the sun. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At nightfall, energy runs out and new predators appear. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How many sunrises will you survive? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2088590/extras/aab6e859624b29c3d512f71ad795369a.poster.avif?t=1785936675\" width=640 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2088590/extras/aab6e859624b29c3d512f71ad795369a.webm?t=1785936675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2088590/extras/aab6e859624b29c3d512f71ad795369a.mp4?t=1785936675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Travel through different environments and unravel the mystery</h2>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stricken with amnesia in the heart of a scorched land, you are the target of ruthless hordes. To triumph in the hellish world of Eleven Sunrises, combine exploration, firepower, and defensive strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2088590/extras/52f8c16af750aed9a7d44c67a99604d2.poster.avif?t=1785936675\" width=640 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2088590/extras/52f8c16af750aed9a7d44c67a99604d2.webm?t=1785936675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2088590/extras/52f8c16af750aed9a7d44c67a99604d2.mp4?t=1785936675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why are you here ?  Are there any other survivors? </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the Wastelands</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2088590/extras/7b32d4489e5df5b1252d60c20624db14.poster.avif?t=1785936675\" width=640 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2088590/extras/7b32d4489e5df5b1252d60c20624db14.webm?t=1785936675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2088590/extras/7b32d4489e5df5b1252d60c20624db14.mp4?t=1785936675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore and conquer new territories. During this trip, you will find the food and weapons necessary for your survival. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Your Line of Defense</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2088590/extras/ed71b3b428bbba78277996db1a8d109f.po